{
 "about": "Action-battle JoJo Links (TeamInfo.jojoLinkList, docs/research/26-links-and-skills.md §1, docs/research/30-action-battle.md §7). The server checks each team: a link is active when one of its rules holds (at least \"min\" distinct groups each have a seat statue whose family, statueId[:4], is in the group; rules are OR'd) or, for a trait link, when at least \"min\" seat statues carry the tribe in their tribeTypeList. Assists do not count. An active link is sent as {charaLinkId, abilityId JOLINK_<nnn>, abilityInfo {abilityName, abilityParamList, isInit true}} and applies to all three members. Units as action_abilities.json (Lv10 = Lv1). \"held\" lists the links not served with our reason. Built by tools/content/build_jojo_links.py.",
